id: power-of-the-hera
name: Power of the Hera
order: 3
category: body
importance: secondary
description: >
  As a warrior race, Herans’ bodies overflow with energy, which they redirect into their attacks.
text: >
  Power of the Hera (Body): As a warrior race, Herans’ bodies overflow with energy, which they redirect into their attacks.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the maximum amount of Energy Charges you can apply to your Attacking Maneuver by your maximum amount of Power stacks.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use the Energy Charge Maneuver, gain a stack of Power until the start of your next turn.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you Defeat a Character or knock a Character through a Health Threshold with your Attacking Maneuver, you may use the Power Up Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you use an Ultimate Signature Technique, you may spend any number of Greed stacks to apply an equal amount of Energy Charges to that Attacking Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) Power's ceiling, whatever raises it, on every Profile's (maneuvers.mjs maxEnergyCharges).
allow charges.byPowerMax;
# (3) Knocked through a Health Threshold, or Defeated, by your Attacking Maneuver: the Power Up offered on that attack's
# card out of sequence, once a Round - counted when taken (chat.mjs offerHeraPowerUp).
allow powerUp.heraKnock;
# (4) An Ultimate Signature Technique declared, once an Encounter: how many Greed stacks, as many Energy Charges - spent
# then (maneuvers.mjs withGreedCharges).
allow greed.ultimateCharges;

# (2) The Energy Charge Maneuver used: a stack of Power till the start of your next turn. Automatic by default, its
# Triggered/Automatic button; set Triggered, asked in the window as it is declared.
[triggered/declare-maneuver, 1/round, toggle, effect 2]
requires using("energy-charge") && roomFor("power");
power.stacks += 1;
expires(power, start-of-next-turn);
